employees, and stockholders by enhancing the health and well-being of pets, people, and livestock.","zh":"我們的目標是成為一家偉大的公司，透過改善寵物、人和牲畜的健康和福祉，為我們的客戶、員工和股東創造卓越的長期價值。"},{"en":"We operate primarily through three reportable business segments: Companion Animal Group, Water quality products, and Livestock, Poultry and Dairy. Our Other operating segment combines and presents our human medical diagnostic products business with our out-licensing arrangement because they do not meet the quantitative or qualitative thresholds for reportable segments.","zh":"我們主要透過三個可報告業務部門運作：伴侶動物集團、水質產品以及畜牧、家禽和乳製品。我們的其他經營部門將我們的人類醫療診斷產品業務與我們的外包許可安排結合起來，因為它們不符合可報告部門的定量或定性閾值。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Companion Animal Group","val":3953285000,"zh":"伴侶動物群體部門"},{"name":"Water","val":201149000,"zh":"水務部門"},{"name":"Livestock & Poultry Diagnostics","val":131787000,"zh":"畜禽診斷部門"}],"total":4303702000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":2539210000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":1764492000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":4303702000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":3010521000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":2752785000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":937252000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":355929000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Europethe Middle Eastand Africa Other","val":230031000,"zh":"歐洲中東非洲其他"},{"name":"DE","val":206759000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"CA","val":167325000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"GB","val":154435000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"FR","val":126003000,"zh":"FR"},{"name":"Asia Pacific Other","val":124364000,"zh":"亞太地區其他"}],"total":4303702000}},"peers":["ZTS","DXCM","MTD","ALGN","RMD"]}}